<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- Shadow Walk -->
  <!--原中文: '暗影步', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Shadow Walk',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Shadow Walk-->
  <TM_ShadowWalk.label>暗影步</TM_ShadowWalk.label>
  <!--原中文: '让影行者出现在另一个生物的影子中。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Move unseen to instantly reappear in the shadow of another pawn.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Move unseen to instantly reappear in the shadow of another pawn.-->
  <TM_ShadowWalk.description>让影行者出现在另一个生物的影子中。</TM_ShadowWalk.description>
  <!-- Shadow Strike -->
  <!--原中文: '暗影之击', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Shadow Strike',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Shadow Strike-->
  <TM_ShadowStrike.label>暗影之击</TM_ShadowStrike.label>
  <!--原中文: '立即将攻击者移动到目标后面，并进行毁灭性的单目标攻击。攻击者获得5秒的加速。攻击者将在5秒后返回他们发起攻击的位置。此攻击可能造成3倍伤害的暴击-随着武器变重，几率降低。远程武器永远不会发出致命一击。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Instantly moves the attacker behind the target and delivers a devastating, single target attack. The attacker gains 5s of haste. The attacker will return to the location they initiated the attack after 5 seconds. This attack may perform critical hits for 3x damage - chance decreases as the weapon gets heavier. Ranged weapons will never deliver critical hits.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Instantly moves the attacker behind the target and delivers a devastating, single target attack. The attacker gains 5s of haste. The attacker will return to the location they initiated the attack after 5 seconds. This attack may perform critical hits for 3x damage - chance decreases as the weapon gets heavier. Ranged weapons will never deliver critical hits.-->
  <TM_ShadowStrike.description>立即将攻击者移动到目标后面，并进行毁灭性的单目标攻击。攻击者获得5秒的加速。攻击者将在5秒后返回他们发起攻击的位置。此攻击可能造成3倍伤害的暴击-随着武器变重，几率降低。远程武器永远不会发出致命一击。</TM_ShadowStrike.description>
  <!-- Nightshade -->
  <!--原中文: '夜毒', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Nightshade',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Nightshade-->
  <TM_Nightshade.label>夜毒</TM_Nightshade.label>
  <!--原中文: '把你的武器或子弹涂上夜毒。每次攻击都会产生一部分夜毒。远程攻击和近战攻击一样只能使用40%的毒素。受影响的受害者会产生幻觉和呼吸短促，如果夜毒造成的状态变得严重，夜毒将会对器官造成损害。此战技需要30体力才能维持并减少50%的体力回复。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Coat your weapons or projectiles in nightshade toxin. Each attack will apply a portion of the nightshade toxin. Ranged attacks apply toxin 40% as efficiently as melee attacks. Affected victims suffer from hallucinations and shortness of breath and will take organ damage if toxicity levels become severe.
		
This ability requires 30 stamina to maintain and reduces stamina regeneration by 50%.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Coat your weapons or projectiles in nightshade toxin. Each attack will apply a portion of the nightshade toxin. Ranged attacks apply toxin 40% as efficiently as melee attacks. Affected victims suffer from hallucinations and shortness of breath and will take organ damage if toxicity levels become severe.
		
This ability requires 30 stamina to maintain and reduces stamina regeneration by 50%.-->
  <TM_Nightshade.description>把你的武器或子弹涂上夜毒。每次攻击都会产生一部分夜毒。远程攻击和近战攻击一样只能使用40%的毒素。受影响的受害者会产生幻觉和呼吸短促，如果夜毒造成的状态变得严重，夜毒将会对器官造成损害。此战技需要30体力才能维持并减少50%的体力回复。</TM_Nightshade.description>
  <!-- Veil of Shadows -->
  <!--原中文: '暗影面纱', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Veil of Shadows',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Veil of Shadows-->
  <TM_VeilOfShadows.label>暗影面纱</TM_VeilOfShadows.label>
  <!--原中文: '投掷一种混合物，使施法者和周围区域笼罩在烟雾和阴影中。施法者获得【暗影斗篷（隐身）】BUFF。阴影将阻止自动系统的瞄准，并将远程攻击的准确性降低60%。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Throw a concoction that cloaks the caster and surrounding area in smoke and shadows. Caster gains Cloak of Shadows (invisibility). The shadow cloud will prevent targeting from automated system and reduces the accuracy of ranged attacks by 60%.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Throw a concoction that cloaks the caster and surrounding area in smoke and shadows. Caster gains Cloak of Shadows (invisibility). The shadow cloud will prevent targeting from automated system and reduces the accuracy of ranged attacks by 60%.-->
  <TM_VeilOfShadows.description>投掷一种混合物，使施法者和周围区域笼罩在烟雾和阴影中。施法者获得【暗影斗篷（隐身）】BUFF。阴影将阻止自动系统的瞄准，并将远程攻击的准确性降低60%。</TM_VeilOfShadows.description>
</LanguageData>
